0 Toolo rear spoiler: broad tapered support webs and curved aerofoil (Local simplified part)
0 Name: dev-toolo/tail-body.dat
0 Author: STEAMX local reconstruction
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Part
0 !LICENSE Licensed under CC BY 4.0 : see CAreadme.txt
0 !HELP User approved local simplified models 2026-09-12; LEGO set 45002 inventory and product photos.
0 !HELP Source p13 wing-top mounting requires stud clearance: four underside pockets at Y/Z+-20, R12.3, depth11.5; inferred, not measured. Rails startX12 to retain solid pocket roofs.
0 !HELP Real31239c01: https://www.bricklink.com/v2/catalog/catalogitem.page?P=31239c01
0 !HELP Shape from catalog blue-part photo and elephant p5/p12; mounting X0 and screw axis-X retained.
0 !HELP Two broad tapered side webs, open center window, curved transverse foil with rolled edges.
0 !HELP Photo review 2026-10-15: DECOTOYS rear-spoiler views confirm two separated arched supports, an open center, and one continuous curved top foil with rolled end lips; this candidate retains the X mount and screw axis.
0 !HELP Image-inferred dimensions and screw representation; no physical-fit certification.
0 !HELP 40 LDU stud pitch; body dimensions inferred. Holes are real open mesh; screw threads and fit are NOT exact.
